  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist (pruned to causal pillar columns)",
  "url": "https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce/versions/2",
  "description": "Subset of the Olist dataset limited to the 6 CSV files and 30 columns referenced by the causal pillar KPI set (Delivery, Seller, Product, Payments, Reviews) plus the grouping keys seller_id / customer_id / customer_state. The analysis unit is one delivered order; review_score is the causal target."
}